{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There's a whole Giant House full of resources, and also hazards... but everything is much more dangerous when you're the size of a bug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out to explore every corner and open paths to new areas until you discover the mystery hidden in the Witch's Attic. Rest at night at The Red Watering-Can to recharge, prepare your backpack, and help other Elusive ones to earn your place in their community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/712fb893b22473b0996304f757821766.poster.avif?t=1768561155\" width=1116 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/712fb893b22473b0996304f757821766.webm?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/712fb893b22473b0996304f757821766.mp4?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>wide set of 3D and 2D scenarios</strong>, from the Garden to the Witch's Attic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrow whatever you need to <strong>craft powerful tools</strong> and get new acrobatic moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your small size</strong> to hide or face your enemies \u2014 Choose wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect unexpected treasures</strong>, upgrades and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your place in <strong>a new Elusive community</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/6e5835f197b705d6b87ddc0efa00abd5.avif?t=1768561155\" width=630 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Backpack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Scissor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Cloak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All set for the raid!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/eb165f6e5bbda2ab9efd5065b3d0e569.poster.avif?t=1768561155\" width=1116 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/eb165f6e5bbda2ab9efd5065b3d0e569.webm?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/eb165f6e5bbda2ab9efd5065b3d0e569.mp4?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master all your skills and tools to <strong>fully explore 3D and 2D scenarios</strong>, each one will challenge you in a different way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/bfcf699639f129e738e18206820a31fe.poster.avif?t=1768561155\" width=1116 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/bfcf699639f129e738e18206820a31fe.webm?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/bfcf699639f129e738e18206820a31fe.mp4?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your acrobatic moves</strong> to dodge dangers, or face them head-on with your sharp Scissor Sword. But be careful, some threats will be too big for you to handle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/e6440a4001e07e22937d5dd119c2d737.poster.avif?t=1768561155\" width=1116 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/e6440a4001e07e22937d5dd119c2d737.webm?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/e6440a4001e07e22937d5dd119c2d737.mp4?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for materials to <strong>upgrade your equipment</strong>, useful items for other Elusive, and pay attention to the marks left behind by other raiders before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/56403d0bd0ca754051dd22af33e95de4.poster.avif?t=1768561155\" width=1116 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/56403d0bd0ca754051dd22af33e95de4.webm?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/56403d0bd0ca754051dd22af33e95de4.mp4?t=1768561155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>you\u2019re exhausted or your backpack gets too heavy</strong>, fly back to the Elusive community shelter. Don't worry, more adventures await you tomorrow! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519500?t=1768561155","background_raw":"https: